1.wLYdUmmac5qX1tv7uHdM-w-uHQOL63y27PhG5NQXzWo" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">re=
jecting any attempts to control it</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The buzz around AI has lifted technology s=
tocks and helped South Korea=E2=80=99s Kospi gain 0.5%, while the Taiwan st=
ock market rose 0.75%. Japanese markets are closed for the silver holiday. =
China=E2=80=99s CSI 300 fell 0.5%.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">There has been strong uptake of Meta=E2=80=
=99s new personal Muse agent, which has been at the top of the US app downl=
oad charts since its launch a fortnight ago.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The dollar has climbed to a two-month high=
 on expectations of interest rate increases soon. Sterling dipped 0.2% to $=
1.3316, while the euro eased to its weakest level since July, falling 0.2% =
to $1.1423.</p>
